<!--
    Emberline: icons. Cut for this theme on a 24 grid as stencil blocks: 3px bars, square ends, right angles, the way
    the source's tray and prompt glyphs read at small sizes. None are traced from the game.
    IconMainMenu is the theme's own mark: a cog-tooth ring broken by a slanted gap with one shard in it
    (art/mark.svg; no skull, no owner mark).
    Playnite's menu icons keep their icofont glyphs; only their hardcoded colors move onto theme brushes.
-->
